==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07~3.33 seconds<sup>2f~100f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*200 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~4 seconds<sup>100f~120f</sup>.
**4 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

